B.aSo=new A.cu("\ud83d\udc06","Macan Tutul","Leopard","Macan tutul Jawa berukuran kecil tapi gesit.","The Javan leopard is small but very agile.",B.dP)
B.aST=new A.cu("\u2601\ufe0f","Awan Gunung","Mountain Cloud",'Awan di puncak gunung sering disebut "topi" gunung.','Clouds atop a mountain are often called its "hat".',B.fr)
