B.V6=new A.M("Terraced Fields","The terraced rice fields need water. Each plot gets a fair share.","Share fairly \u2014 do not take more than your right.",B.a4)
B.W8=new A.M("River Source","The mountain river is so clear. Do not wash trash at the source.","Care for the water up high \u2014 the village below stays healthy.",B.a_)
