B.Wq=new A.M("Fair Chief","The village chief shares help fairly and openly with everyone.","A fair and honest leader is respected by all.",B.be)
B.YH=new A.M("The Midwife","The midwife helps a sick neighbor. She is amazing!","Those who help many people \u2014 respect and thank them.",B.af)
B.Yf=new A.M("After the Rain","Heavy rain makes the road slippery and muddy. The people pitch in.","In hard times, helping each other speeds the recovery.",B.H)
B.XF=new A.M("Great Harvest","The whole village harvests together. The crop is shared fairly.","Work together, enjoy together \u2014 that is lovely.",B.a4)
