B.X_=new A.M("Harvest Feast","The village celebrates the harvest. All eat and laugh together.","Be thankful for the crop and share the joy with neighbors.",B.H)
B.VY=new A.M("Farewell Greeting","Kiko says goodbye. Kiss the grandparents' hands before leaving.","Say a polite goodbye \u2014 a sign of love and respect.",B.af)
B.W_=new A.M("Village Friend","The last day in the mountains. The final boss awaits!","Respect for parents, teachers, and neighbors \u2014 that is who you are.",B.af)
