B.Xl=new A.M("City Park","The park is green and cool. Do not step on the grass or pick flowers.","Care for public places like your own home.",B.a_)
B.WC=new A.M("Lost Child","A little child cries looking for their mom. Walk them to the guard post.","Help those in trouble \u2014 do not ignore them in a crowd.",B.H)
