B.W7=new A.M("Zero Gravity","Things float in space. Tidy them up so nothing gets lost.","Be neat and orderly \u2014 wherever you are.",B.a4)
B.US=new A.M("Earth from Above","From the window, Earth looks small, blue, and beautiful.","Earth is our only home \u2014 take good care of it.",B.H)
